{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/extras/b26f99edcfc03237a31918337976acd6.avif?t=1772160183\" width=616 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game of Fitna: Vol 1</strong> takes place in <strong>2030</strong> at <strong>Preisotus High School \u2013 Wisdom Heaven</strong>, an elite academy where only the best can attend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Zayn</strong>, the lowest-ranked student in the school. One day, you receive a mysterious message about a <strong>TEST</strong>. Soon, you realize you're not alone\u2014six of your classmates have been pulled into it as well. There's no way to refuse, and no way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed by the school itself, this trial is more than just a test. It\u2019s a game of strategy, trust, and deception\u2014where failure comes at a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by psychological thrillers, high-stakes death games, and Arabian folklore, Game of Fitna is a story of ambition, morality, and the price of success.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you make it through?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/extras/fb3812fdb78677058d9584a22864fa58.avif?t=1772160183\" width=616 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/extras/615ead47ecbf28a46ea8cdb596b76791.avif?t=1772160183\" width=616 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Game of Fitna Vol.1\u00a0</i>, you will meet a cast of different ideologies and characters, each carrying their own burdens. Some may be allies, others enemies, and some will blur the line between the two. You'll have the chance to talk to them, uncover bits of their truths\u2014but be careful. In a game like this, trust is a dangerous gamble.<br><br><strong>The Protagonist of this story, Zayn \u2013 Ranked 100</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/extras/8c8427fe017c75a332f28c9f34352bdd.avif?t=1772160183\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/extras_big/8c8427fe017c75a332f28c9f34352bdd.avif?t=1772160183 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Najma The ???-- Ranked ???</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/extras/4faafdf9345956353ebc28ba008db323.avif?t=1772160183\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/extras_big/4faafdf9345956353ebc28ba008db323.avif?t=1772160183 width=800 height=450 /></span><strong><br><br>Noor, The Humanist \u2013 Ranked 99</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/extras/a3c7a27ec4861c5149783f4f1f733b5d.avif?t=1772160183\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/extras_big/a3c7a27ec4861c5149783f4f1f733b5d.avif?t=1772160183 width=800 height=450 /></span><strong>Adam, The Anarchist \u2013 Ranked 98</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/extras/2109106660c79ce3c6baef69c5f6e6e3.avif?t=1772160183\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725340/extras_big/2109106660c79ce3c6baef69c5f6e6e3.avif?t=1772160183 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_p